notes = "All 101 members were read in full, including test assertions and embedded compiler fixtures. Arbitrum L1 sequencer/inbox and DA references describe optional external chain support, not a retired Paxeer daemon. The merged deployment uses paxeer_x. No source repair or dependency change is part of this record. Requirements 22108.1, 14991.1 and acceptance 22998.1 do not gain install, typecheck or runtime qualification evidence from this audit record."
